WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.067
-It's the end of the week, and that's usually when

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:04.234
I catch up with some personal stuff.

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:05.534
I check my inbox, I return some e-mails,

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:06.901
and, of course, I send out Thank You Notes.

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:08.434
And I was running a bit behind.

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:10.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:12.200
I'd like to write out some Thank You Notes right now

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.667
if that's okay with you.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.167
Roots, can you -- Thank you.

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:16.601
♪♪

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.234
Appreciate it.

00:00:18.234 --> 00:00:24.367
♪♪

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:27.400
Thank you, appetizers that come in threes,

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.100
for guaranteeing that this date

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.801
is gonna get awkward real quick.

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:32.734
[ Applause ]

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.133
-For you. -For you.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:37.934
-No, no, no. Go ahead. Go ahead.

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:39.834
-I'm not even that hungry.

00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:41.200
♪♪

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.300
Thank you, door-knockers,

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.934
for being like if my front door got a nipple ring.

00:00:45.934 --> 00:00:47.734
[ Applause ]

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:49.234
-Hey, don't kink-shame.

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:50.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.434
♪♪

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:59.300
-Thank you, Dream from "The Sandman,"

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.601
for looking like if Tom Brady came out of retirement

00:01:01.601 --> 00:01:03.300
to play for My Chemical Romance.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.467
[ Applause ]

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:06.801
Okay.

00:01:10.434 --> 00:01:11.801
♪♪

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:14.601
Thank you, suitcases, for being a great way

00:01:14.601 --> 00:01:17.434
to carry every item of clothing except suits.

00:01:17.434 --> 00:01:19.167
[ Applause ]

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:27.267
♪♪

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:30.501
Thank you, "The Bachelorette's" Gabby and Rachel,

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:33.801
for looking like I tried to draw the Bush twins from memory.

00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:35.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:36.601
[ Applause ]

00:01:36.601 --> 00:01:38.033
-Almost...

00:01:43.934 --> 00:01:45.300
♪♪

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.334
-Thank you, apple crumble,

00:01:47.334 --> 00:01:49.767
for being a muffin that took off its Spanx.

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:52.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:53.667
[ Applause ]

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:56.901
-"Ahh! Finally!

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:58.767
Are you gonna eat that appetizer?"

00:01:58.767 --> 00:02:00.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:05.200
♪♪

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.200
-Thank you, acorns,

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.601
for being hazelnuts that went to Paris.

00:02:09.601 --> 00:02:11.601
Ooh! -Ooh.

00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:13.467
[ Applause ]

00:02:13.467 --> 00:02:15.834
-"Oui, oui!" -"Oh, oui oui, Mr. Squirrel!"

00:02:15.834 --> 00:02:18.667
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:18.667 --> 00:02:20.868
-"Bonjour."

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:22.200
♪♪

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.601
-Thank you, riding lawnmowers, for convincing dads

00:02:25.601 --> 00:02:27.434
it's a good idea to drink four beers

00:02:27.434 --> 00:02:30.367
and then climb on top of an upside-down helicopter.

00:02:30.367 --> 00:02:32.634
There you have it. Those are my Thank You Notes.

